			- _description = { IDescription 
				- _textRTF = "{\\rtf1\\fbidis\\ansi\\ansicpg1255\\deff0\\deflang1037{\\fonttbl{\\f0\\fnil\\fcharset0 MS Sans Serif;}{\\f1\\fnil\\fcharset177 MS Sans Serif;}}
\\viewkind4\\uc1\\pard\\ltrpar\\f0\\fs17 The home alarm can be armed and disarmed via a simple remote control that has two keys \"arm\" and \"disarm\"\\par
\\par
The alarm can also be armed and disarmed by using a simple  keypad installed in the house. Once armed the homeowner has 5 seconds to exit the house. When entering the house, the homeowner has 5 seconds to disarm the code.\\par
\\par
To arm :      press 4 keys to enter code\\par
                   press key on\\par
\\par
To disarm :  press 4 keys to enter code\\par
                   press key off\\par
\\par
When armed the red led will be on.\\f1\\rtlch\\par
}
";
			}
			- weakCGTime = 11.23.2003::14:18:27;
			- strongCGTime = 11.23.2003::14:18:27;
