\\viewkind4\\uc1\\pard\\ltrpar\\f0\\fs17 To change the code, the homeowner must do the following :\\par
\\par
key on\\par
enter old code\\par
key on\\par
enter new code\\par
key on\\par
\\par
If the code is successfully changed the green led will flash four times.\\f1\\rtlch\\par
}
";
			}
