\\viewkind4\\uc1\\pard\\ltrpar\\f0\\fs17 The keypad has ten keys numbered 0 through 9.\\par
A code is any four digits.\\par
By default the code is 1234\\par
\\par
If at any time a mistake is made, the Off key can be pressed to restart entering the code.\\par
\\par
\\f1\\rtlch\\par
}
";
