\\viewkind4\\uc1\\pard\\ltrpar\\f0\\fs17 Will detect two types of intrusion:\\par
\\par
1. The door will allow a temporised delay for entering into the house and disarming the alarm. \\par
\\par
2. A movement detection will action the alarm immediately.\\par
\\f1\\rtlch\\par
}
";
			}
